- Achievement related to collectibles that were collected prior to patch 1.1 can now be completed by entering the main menu;

- Completionist achievement can also be completed in the main menu;

- Fixed a bug in The High School where you could see The Teacher's body before going into the the final room;

- Map loading issues in the Museum were fixed;

- Changed a few achievement names and icons.

- Other crashes, lags and bugs fixed.

Thank you for your continued support!
